WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:08.360
<i>Loving someone is noble. Love overcomes
any difficulties, and opens a future.</i>

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.160
Aoyama kun, I’m really sorry!

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:16.160
Aoyama-kun!

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:49.730
He’s not here.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:02.500
Isn’t it obvious?

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:07.330
I’m so late and I didn’t even call him.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.510
Of course, he’s bound to hate me.

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:31.770
I’ll just go home before I catch a cold.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.030
Aoyama-kun!

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:57.040
I arrived late... because...

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.580
I can’t say it.

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:05.590
I can’t say I’m a Mew Mew and fought with
the enemy at Tokyo Tower earlier on.

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:06.970
I...

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:13.560
I can’t say a single word
to Aoyama-kun.

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:18.680
It’s always the same...

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:20.490
...always lying like that.

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:25.830
Do I still have the right to love Aoyama-kun?

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:30.240
I should just calm down and tell him.

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:38.840
Aoyama-kun...

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:42.800
I’m sorry...

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:49.640
And... Thank you. For everything.

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:55.650
I’m such an idiot, why am I crying?

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.900
I’ve been waiting for you.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:05.320
Ichigo...

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:11.250
...I love you.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:16.450
Is this a dream?

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:22.340
Aoyama-kun’s shirt...

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:24.710
His hair...

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:27.350
His fragrance...

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:34.810
It’s not a dream!

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.560
He’s so close to me!

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:42.860
Ichigo...

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:45.530
Your hair is in a terrible mess.

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:53.790
No!

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:57.880
Ichigo!?

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:01.840
Why? Why do my cat ears have to appear now?!

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:03.840
Ichigo!

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.340
I understand.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.440
I’m sorry I shocked you.

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:16.520
Use this.

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:19.770
I’ll go home.

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:22.730
Wait...

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:35.620
I don’t think I can really hide my ears
with this, but still, I want to tell him.

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:40.120
I...

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:42.950
This feeling!

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:44.540
you...

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:50.510
Just this thought, I want you to know how I feel...

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:54.340
...love you.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:01.590
A..Aoyama-kun!

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:02.770
...don’t move.

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:05.190
Just a little longer.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.650
...let’s just be here a little longer.

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:12.150
God, I beg you.

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:14.280
Please don’t stop this rain.

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:16.870
Just a little longer...

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.540
Just for a little bit longer...

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:22.800
Please let my ears stay hidden.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:31.350
Why? Why? Why? Why is Ichigo in such
a daze first thing in the morning?

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.380
Am I?

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:38.880
Even though I didn’t get home until midnight from my business trip, I’m totally fine!

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:41.930
A young girl like you should have even more energy!

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:44.390
Is that so?

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:46.280
It’s good to be so cheerful.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:49.690
Don’t tell me you’re in a daze because
you fell in love with someone?

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:54.480
It’s a joke!

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:58.250
A crude girl like you get a boyfriend?
That’ll be the day!

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:01.830
Oh look at the time!
I really gotta rush to work now!

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:06.880
What’s his problem?

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.890
Ichigo, you returned home very late yesterday.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:15.430
Your father didn’t notice it because he returned late.

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:17.350
Did anything happen?

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.310
No... Nothing at all.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:25.530
Although we can trust you this time, you really should come back earlier in future.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:29.520
I will. I... I’ve really got to be leaving now!

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:35.120
Hmm? It’s definitely got something
to do with Aoyama-kun!

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:54.340
I feel great!

00:06:56.920 --> 00:07:02.180
It’s as if the world has changed –
everything is so perfect.

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:04.900
<i>I love you.</i>

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.820
<i>I love you too!</i>

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:14.740
You gave me a shock!

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:18.200
Ichigo! Just what are you dreaming of
at this time in the morning?

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.780
Oh... er... nothing really. I...

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:22.670
You were acting pretty suspiciously.

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:27.210
Well now, let’s all run along to school... ah ha ha!

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:30.370
Hmm, it’s suspicious.

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:32.170
Extremely suspicious...

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:37.800
Quiche! What have you done to Deep Blue-sama?

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:42.190
Although he gives the orders,
he never shows himself,

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:47.150
with such existence, can he really
be the saviour of our planet?

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.550
Are you doubting me?

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:51.060
No.

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:58.080
But I suspect that you exist rather
like an embryo. Not yet born.

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:04.950
Even though you have your consciousness,
you cant control your power.

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:06.610
Did I guess wrong?

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:07.860
That can’t be right.

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:10.120
Do you mean that you will not accept me as your leader?

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.280
No.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:12.970
I would never dream of such a thing.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:19.470
You are our leader and we have
been together for a long time.

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:21.340
Then what do you mean?

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:27.650
In order for you to become our true master,
let us awaken your powers.

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:30.610
Using the power of Mew Aqua!

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:36.350
In order for this to happen I deliberately
gave them Mew Aqua,

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:44.580
and I poured its power into this dimension,
thinking that it would help you to awaken.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.490
But why did you deceive us?

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:49.970
If I’d told you about it,
you’d have stopped me!

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:53.870
Indeed this was risky
for Deep Blue-sama.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:55.550
How dare you!

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:55.550
Deep Blue-sama!

00:08:56.080 --> 00:09:00.140
If you are going to save the people of my planet,

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:03.590
I don’t mind, even if I receive a death sentence.

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:05.270
So what do you think?

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:12.690
All right. I expect you to get me
more power from Mew Aqua.

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:20.200
Did you understand? You’ll have
to keep helping me, okay?

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:25.620
Do not try to deceive me again, or you will be sorry for it.

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:27.410
I know that.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:30.710
Well, let’s plan our next scheme!

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:46.250
Aoyama-kun! Are you done with your practice?

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.840
Yeah.

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.190
Ichigo, would you like to go home together?

00:09:49.510 --> 00:09:50.470
Ehh!?

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:56.180
Um, what should I say?

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:57.780
You go ahead. Don’t mind us!

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:02.490
I’m sorry. I’ll be off then...

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.360
Hmm. Isn’t the atmosphere a little different?

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:09.120
Maybe she’s confessed her feelings for him?

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:12.750
Ah! That’s why... this morning...

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:15.460
She’s so lucky!

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:27.460
Hmm. What nice weather.

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:28.970
Yes it is.

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:38.360
I can’t think why, but I’m kind of nervous right now.

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:42.320
Wow. Aoyama-kun’s eyelashes are so long...

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:47.110
What’s wrong?

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:48.490
Er– nothing!

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:51.740
Oh, thats right. You need to go
to the shop after this, right?

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:52.540
Er. Yeah.

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:55.500
Actually, I have a favour to ask.

00:10:57.450 --> 00:10:59.470
It’s really shocking.

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:02.370
We still can’t remove it from this state.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:05.180
It’s too dangerous, we should keep it somewhere safe.

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:06.380
Yes.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.850
If I put it in here, then no one will be able
to get to it without going through me.

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:21.580
Ah. Sorry I’m late again.

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.690
Oh no... Everyone is indeed
angry with me.

00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:29.540
What should I do?

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:29.540
As expected!

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:31.690
Bu-Ling’s guess is correct!

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:34.070
Ichigo-neechan is indeed moody today.

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:36.000
Ichigo-san, please cheer up!

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:40.470
People say that falling out of love
is part of growing up...

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.380
F-Falling out of love?

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:43.750
Yes.

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:48.500
How could there be an oniichan who’s
willing to wait for so long in the rain?

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:50.350
He must’ve dumped you so hard.

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:54.360
I didn’t get dumped at all.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.770
Huh?

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:01.190
As a matter of fact, we happened to find
out that were in love with each other...

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:08.370
WHAT?!!

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:11.520
Is that so? Everyone was so worried about it!

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:14.400
If that’s true you should have told us sooner!

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:18.710
Hm... there is indeed such an oniichan
around, it’s a miracle...

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.370
Indeed.

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:21.300
Isn’t that a relief?

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:27.310
Now, be-because he said he would
like to try the cake here....

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:29.180
Huh?

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:31.430
...right now... he...

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:34.390
...came here.

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:37.440
He-Hello everyone.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.890
Ichigo-neechan’s boyfriend has
come here to try our cake!

00:12:40.890 --> 00:12:42.440
Welcome.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:46.020
Bu-Ling... boyfriend is a...

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:46.910
But it’s true, isn’t it?

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:50.450
Well, it’s not exactly wrong, but...

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:55.830
Wah! I... I’m just going to get changed.

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:07.050
He and Ichigo-san seem to be getting along well.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.110
Is something wrong?

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:12.110
No, not at all.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:14.400
Seems that everything has worked out, Ichigo-san.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:18.670
Oh boy... everyone’s...

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:21.820
Trouble! Trouble! Aliens! Aliens!

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.150
They’re near!

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:28.780
So this is their hideout...

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:32.750
Yes, and the design is kind of cute, don’t you think?

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:35.750
Now, let’s give them a big one!

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:41.410
Just a minute! W-What are you doing, Shirogane?!

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:44.050
It’s just a sleeping drug, don’t worry.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:47.010
You can’t transform in front of him, can you?

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:49.160
Keiichirou, take him to a safe place.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.410
I will.

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:51.970
Alright people, listen up.

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:56.190
The reason they’re here is most likely
the Mew Aqua. I’m counting on you.

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:04.030
I’ll take “fruit à la mode” –
with Mew Aqua, please!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.970
I’m sorry, sir, that’s not on the menu.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:06.530
Huh?

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:11.480
Well, we’ll just have to defeat you and search for it.

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:14.490
Hurry up and transform,
we’ll be waiting.

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:18.460
Thank you for your kind consideration.
I’ll be sure to return the favour.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:19.420
Mew Mew Pomegranate!

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:20.420
Mew Mew Pudding!

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:21.420
Mew Mew Lettuce!

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:22.340
Mew Mew Mint!

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:23.800
Mew Mew Strawberry!

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.790
METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:08.470
Oh no!

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:09.790
Aoyama-kun!

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:13.470
We are also very serious here.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:16.430
Isn’t it better if you just apologize?

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:17.890
Don’t think well let you have your way!

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:20.060
Aoyama kun!

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:23.060
Yo! Little kitty. Hello there!

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:24.430
Quiche!

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:25.970
Where’s the Mew Aqua?

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:27.530
What makes you think I will tell you?

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:30.270
Oh, you’re very defiant!

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:32.870
What?

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:39.960
PuddingRings INFERNO!!

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:43.670
Bu-Ling’s PuddingRings puddings
are so puddingy, aren’t they?

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:44.630
Bu-Ling!

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:48.590
At a time like this, Ichigo-neechan should use the staff!

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:50.050
Wait! Bu-Ling!

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:54.720
Uh? What happened to
Akasaka-oniichan?

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.210
It’s nothing you need to know about.

00:15:56.210 --> 00:15:58.060
Oh, now I know!

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:58.790
Keep quiet!

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:02.130
In order to defeat you,
he’s gone to get the staff!

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.760
Oh... so where did he go?

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.680
The basement of course!

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:06.820
You are such a stupid girl!

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:10.530
You girls fight well but what do you think of this?

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:17.190
Reborn... Lettuce RUSH!!

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:22.790
Reborn... Mint ECHO!!

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:25.840
Reborn... Pomegran’ SPEAR!!

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:33.430
Ah! Found you!

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:36.600
Akasaka-san!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:38.010
Ichigo-san!

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:41.270
Got it!

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:47.010
Oh yeah! This it it!

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:51.100
With this Deep Blue-sama will be truly awakened.

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:00.820
What?

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:02.860
What’s wrong? Shine!

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:04.110
So that’s why...

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:04.750
What?

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:11.210
Mew Aqua itself generates no energy. It merely stores it.

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:15.080
<i>Reborn... Aquae Guttae!</i>

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:24.480
In the last battle, most of the energy was used up.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:27.940
Therefore, right now there’s no Mew
Aqua energy left in that staff.

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:29.770
It’s just a stone.

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.230
What did you say?

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:34.430
It seems you told us differently.

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:36.310
So now what, Quiche?

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:38.870
We’re not going to let you off!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.020
So what should we do now, Quiche?

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:43.330
Yeah, it was you who planned this,
after all.

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:45.660
Shut up!

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:49.290
All this nonsense...

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:51.280
Curses!

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:54.330
Dammit! Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!!!

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:56.710
I am being made a fool of!

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:59.220
I will make you all pay for it!

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:00.930
I can’t let you do that!

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:20.660
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:26.400
We will let you off this time.

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:28.530
It’s not like we’ve lost or anything.

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:32.880
We’ve been hit hard.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:36.120
The whole place is a mess right now.

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:38.200
Now it kind of feels like an open concept shop...

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:39.910
That’s one way of looking at it.

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:46.090
Now they know that there’s no Mew Aqua
here, they won’t attack this place again.

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:48.560
Since we don’t know where the rest of the Mew Aqua is,

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:51.010
it looks like we’re back to square one.

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:52.730
Aoyama-kun!

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:56.190
Idiot! Wouldn’t it be better not to wake him right now?

00:18:57.600 --> 00:19:00.400
Keiichirou will bring him.
Hide everything.

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:16.080
He’s still breathing.

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.790
What a relief...

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:26.720
Aoyama-kun. I’m sorry I dragged you into trouble again.

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:39.940
Ah! My cat ears and tail again...

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:43.610
But... it doesn’t matter now...

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:49.910
Huh?

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:55.910
Uh? What?

00:19:55.910 --> 00:19:58.710
Eh, eh... EHH!?

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:10.670
Huh?

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:13.010
Ahh!!! Nyaaa!

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:15.360
NyaaaaaaaaAAAAA~!!

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:18.020
I’ve turned into a cat!!!

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:21.190
Ah!!! Why?

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:26.830
Th- This must be a dream nya!

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:32.130
At last I got together with Aoyama-kun,
but I turned into a cat!

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:34.010
Shouldn’t this be a dream nya?!

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:35.760
It’s not a dream.

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:37.710
There should be some limits to this nya!

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:42.100
What do you think my body is nyaaaa~?

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:44.470
Now, now, don’t get so angry, little kitty.

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:49.770
Next: “Kitty Panic! The key to the mystery is her k.i.s.s.”

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:53.330
I will sue you for this nya~!
